      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for the info. so if i do a soil test and it turns out i'm lacking nitrogen, is there a specific type of granular fertilizer i should look for? also, can you explain the difference between a high-nitrogen fertilizer and a balanced one in terms of how they actually affect the grass over a few weeks?",
