      "role": "user",
      "content": "that makes sense. i'm worried about the soil getting depleted too fast if i keep using the high nitrogen stuff. is there anything else besides the nutrients that makes the grass look unhealthy or prevents it from getting that green color back? like, are there pests or stuff in the soil that could be messing with the uptake?",
